* MATH CALCULATOR

TXTOUT "=== ARITHMETIC CALCULATOR ==="

* SUM
@GET 5
@ &TEMPVAL&
@< "SUM"
SUM &ARGS0& &ARGS1&
@ &RETURN&

* DIFF
@GET 5
@ &TEMPVAL&
@< "DIFF"
DIFF &ARGS0& &ARGS1&
@ &RETURN&

* PROD
@GET 5
@ &TEMPVAL&
@< "PROD"
PROD &ARGS0& &ARGS1&
@ &RETURN&

* QUOT
@GET 5
@ &TEMPVAL&
@< "QUOT"
QUOT &ARGS0& &ARGS1&
@ &RETURN&

@< "START"
TXTIN "args0: "
TEMPSET "ARGS0"
TXTIN "args1: "
TEMPSET "ARGS1"
TXTIN "Operation? (SUM, DIFF, PROD, QUOT): "
TEMPSET "OPERATION"

@GET 3
TEMPSET "RETURN"
@> &OPERATION&
TXTOUT &TEMPVAL&
TXTOUT ""
@> "START"